        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"8fb68f7d-2fa5-4a87-b53f-41b93a581b66\",\"review_text\":\"Is very good\"},{\"review_id\":\"3a3b76bb-ca76-49c6-ab56-81edeb1b451b\",\"review_text\":\"I'll give a 4 because it has to much ads but i still like the app overall\"},{\"review_id\":\"2ec69f89-936c-4c2b-8ea3-27b0d276b1ae\",\"review_text\":\"I have premium which I downloaded music to my offline playlist, nowadays this doesnt want to play when offline. The playlisslts also have to continuosly redownload which is irtating.\"},{\"review_id\":\"656981a7-bdf8-466c-a814-6d7351cd2991\",\"review_text\":\"It's only good if you have premium or else it doesn't really do you justice, overall I do not recommend unless your willing to spend money but what I do recommend is just making music playlists on YouTube, it's free and you get WAY less ads!- but there is one downside to this alternative method to listen to music and it's that you can't turn you phone off and listen to it, Other than that it's a good way to get free music.\"},{\"review_id\":\"4173d61c-3332-4ca2-93a7-f8fd78baa65f\",\"review_text\":\"😡😡😡😠😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"d9183e0e-c12c-44d5-9bb9-65fb2d706643\",\"review_text\":\"I Boycott Spotify And Sweden #Quran_is_love\"},{\"review_id\":\"a512ee46-9d86-4e5c-8397-e97412be1873\",\"review_text\":\"Please add resent played song list 50-100\"},{\"review_id\":\"b0528309-1e61-47de-ae45-0a62430c0679\",\"review_text\":\"It has been awesome\"},{\"review_id\":\"d49c0ed1-f22d-49f2-b86b-47b70be0f652\",\"review_text\":\"Very good Variation in tune 🎶 but only really if you have premium\"},{\"review_id\":\"994c79f7-2831-475d-acfb-86e55e73f824\",\"review_text\":\"🖖🏻\"}]}"
